  "body": "## What changed\n\nThis PR merges the release branch `release/v0.21.0` into `main`. It does not change product code.\n\n- `RECOMMENDED.md`: the cut appends 83 decision files under the `v0.21.0` heading. The files in `docs/decisions/` are removed. `docs/decisions/README.md` stays.\n- `RELEASE_NOTES.md`: a new 0.21.0 section is added at the top.\n- `CHANGELOG.md`: 65 rows for the behaviour PRs that merged since `v0.20.0` are added. No row was marked `Unreleased`.\n- `cargo xtask release --version 0.21.0 --no-tag --skip-gate` writes the version bump to 0.21.0. It makes no tag.\n\n## Start condition\n\n- Start of the cut: 2026-11-15T16:09Z.\n- Open P1 or P2 issues at the start: none.\n- P1 or P2 issues filed after the start: none at 2026-11-15T16:21Z.\n\n## Contents of the release\n\n- 106 PRs merged since `v0.20.0`: 19 `feat`, 65 `fix`, 22 other (`test`, `docs`, `chore`, `ci`, `refactor`).\n- No PR is marked breaking. The project file version stays at 61.\n- Some changes alter the posted G-code of existing projects. The release notes list them in \"Changes to posted programs\". Examples:\n  - Fanuc-family posts write a decimal point on whole-number words (#1836, PR #1866).\n  - G76 threading posts the finish allowance R (#417, PR #517).\n  - Seven mill posts retract Z before a setup-change stop (#1647, PR #1859).\n- No real control ran the output of these post changes. The release notes list them in \"Not exercised on a real control\".\n- Process changes: PROCESS_VERSION 66 to 76.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- The pixel-snapshot lanes were skipped. The maintainer's standing decision is that they have no value at a cut. No PNG changed.\n- The Windows arms of the per-OS pinned readings were skipped.\n- The release gate runs on the cut runner (`cut.yml`, stage `gate`). Its result is not in this body.\n\nChangelog: none\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
